Subject: [PATCH] Register the VPP frame scene header with makedep

The header already belongs to the Vulkan overlay. Wine discovers its
shared headers from include/Makefile.in during config.status.

diff --git a/include/Makefile.in b/include/Makefile.in
index 285035a5..4bfd8053 100644
--- a/include/Makefile.in
+++ b/include/Makefile.in
@@ -994,6 +994,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	wine/svcctl.idl \
 	wine/test.h \
 	wine/unixlib.h \
+	wine/vpp_frame_scene.h \
 	wine/vulkan.h \
 	wine/vulkan_driver.h \
 	wine/wgl.h \
